msgstr ""
"Drag the test tube towards the canvas area to<br> shake the contents of the "
"test tube well. "

#: simcontrols.js:76
msgid ""
"The samples are immiscible in water indicating the presence of oil or fat."
msgstr ""
"The samples are immiscible in water<br> indicating the presence of oil or "
"fat."

#: simcontrols.js:77
msgid ""
"The samples form lower layer, which dissolves on heating indicating the "
"presence of oil or fat."
msgstr ""
"The samples form lower layer, which dissolves on <br>heating indicating the "
"presence of oil or fat."

#: simcontrols.js:78
msgid ""
"The samples are miscible in chloroform indicating the presence of oil or fat."
msgstr ""
"The samples are miscible in chloroform <br>indicating the presence of oil or "
"fat."

