"it."

#: simcontrols.js:85
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the first filter paper to drop vanaspati ghee into "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the first <br>filter paper to drop vegetable ghee "
"into it."

#: simcontrols.js:86
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the first filter paper to drop refined oil into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the first filter paper <br>to drop refined oil into "
"it."

#: simcontrols.js:87
msgid ""
"Drag the filter paper to the lighting candle. Move the <br>filter paper over "
"the flame, the light will be visible <br>only through the spot formed by the "
"desi ghee."
msgstr ""
"Drag the filter paper to the lighting candle. Move the <br>filter paper over "
"the flame, the light will be visible <br>only through the spot formed by the "
"desi ghee."

#: simcontrols.js:87
msgid ""
"Drag the filter paper to the lighting candle. Move the <br>filter paper over "
"the flame, the light will be visible <br>only through the spot formed by the "
"vegetable ghee."
msgstr ""
"Drag the filter paper to the lighting candle. Move the <br>filter paper over "
"the flame, the light will be visible <br>only through the spot formed by the "
"vegetable ghee."

#: simcontrols.js:87
msgid ""
"Drag the filter paper to the lighting candle. Move the <br>filter paper over "
"the flame, the light will be visible <br>only through the spot formed by the "
"refined oil."
msgstr ""
"Drag the filter paper to the lighting candle. Move the <br>filter paper over "
"the flame, the light will be visible <br>only through the spot formed by the "
"refined oil."

#: simcontrols.js:88
msgid ""
"Drag the second filter paper towards the filter paper containing sample to "
"press the sample with it. "
msgstr ""
"Drag the second filter paper towards the filter paper<br> containing sample "
"to press the sample with it. "

#: simcontrols.js:89
msgid ""
"Fats and oils have higher boiling points so at room temperature they cannot "
"absorb enough heat to evaporate. When fat or oil is place on the sheet of "
"paper, it diffracts light. The diffracted light can pass from one side of "
"the paper to another side and gives translucent spot."
msgstr ""
"Fats and oils have higher boiling points so at <br>room temperature they "
"cannot absorb enough heat<br> to evaporate. When fat or oil is place on the "
"<br>sheet of paper, it diffracts light. The diffracted <br>light can pass "
"from one side of the paper <br>to another side and gives translucent spot."

#: simcontrols.js:91
msgid ""
"Drag the spatula towards the test tube to put potassium bisulphate crystals "
"into desi ghee."
msgstr ""
"Drag the spatula towards the test tube to put <br>potassium bisulphate "
"crystals into desi ghee."

#: simcontrols.js:92
msgid ""
"Drag the spatula towards the test tube to put potassium bisulphate crystals "
"into vanaspati ghee."
msgstr ""
"Drag the spatula towards the test tube to put <br>potassium bisulphate "
"crystals into  vegetable ghee."

#: simcontrols.js:93
msgid ""
"Drag the spatula towards the test tube to put potassium bisulphate crystals "
"into refined oil."
msgstr ""
"Drag the spatula towards the test tube to put <br>potassium bisulphate "
"crystals into refined oil."

#: simcontrols.js:94
msgid ""
"Acrolein test is used to detect the presence of glycerol or fat. When fat is "
"treated strongly in presence of dehydrating agent like potassium "
"bisulphate,  the glycerol portion of the molecule is dehydrated to form an "
"unsaturated aldehyde, acrolein that has a pungent irritating odour."
msgstr ""
"Acrolein test is used to detect the presence of glycerol or fat. <br>When "
"fat is treated strongly in presence of dehydrating agent <br>like potassium "
"bisulphate,  the glycerol portion of the molecule<br> is dehydrated to form "
"an unsaturated aldehyde, acrolein <br>that has a pungent irritating odour."

#: simcontrols.js:96
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing melted desi ghee to drop "
"Conc. H2SO4 into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing <br>melted desi ghee to "
"drop Conc.H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>into it."

#: simcontrols.js:97
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing melted desi ghee to drop "
"2% furfural solution in alcohol into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing melted <br>desi ghee to "
"drop 2% furfural solution in alcohol into it."

#: simcontrols.js:97
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing melted vanaspati ghee to "
"drop Conc. H2SO4 into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing<br> melted vanaspati ghee "
"to drop Conc.H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> into it."

#: simcontrols.js:97
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing melted vanaspati ghee to "
"drop 2% furfural solution in alcohol into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing melted<br> vanaspati ghee "
"to drop 2% furfural solution in alcohol into it."

#: simcontrols.js:97
msgid "Wait for some time to complete the reaction."
msgstr "Wait for some time to complete the reaction."

#: simcontrols.js:98
msgid "No charateristic cahnge."
msgstr "No characteristic change."

#: simcontrols.js:99
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This test is used to detect the presence of seasame oil. Seasame oil gives "
"characteristic rose red colour with concentrated hydrochloric acid and "
"furfural solution. Vanaspati ghee contains 5% seasame oil while pure desi "
"ghee does not contain seasame oil."
msgstr ""
"This test is used to detect the presence of seasame oil.<br> Seasame oil "
"gives characteristic rose red colour with <br>concentrated hydrochloric acid "
"and furfural solution. <br>Vanaspati ghee contains 5% seasame oil while pure "
"<br>desi ghee does not contain seasame oil."

#: simcontrols.js:101
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing cotton seed oil to drop "
"chloroform into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing<br> cotton seed oil to "
"drop chloroform into it."

#: simcontrols.js:101
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing cotton seed oil to drop "
"Huble reagent into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing <br>cotton seed oil to "
"drop Huble's reagent into it."

#: simcontrols.js:101
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing linseed oil to drop "
"chloroform into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing<br> linseed oil to drop "
"chloroform into it."

#: simcontrols.js:101
msgid ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing linseed oil to drop Huble "
"reagent into it."
msgstr ""
"Drag the dropper towards the test tube containing<br> linseed oil to drop "
"Huble's reagent into it."

#: simcontrols.js:102
msgid ""
"Huble reagent is an alcoholic solution of iodine which contains some "
"mercuric chloride. During the reaction, the violet colour of iodine fades "
"away if the oil or fat is unsaturated. If the oil or fat is saturated, the "
"violet colour of iodine does not fade away. Here linseed oil is more "
"unsaturated than cotton seed oil"
msgstr ""
"Huble's reagent is an alcoholic solution of iodine which <br>contains some "
"mercuric chloride. During the reaction, <br>the violet colour of iodine "
"fades away if the oil or fat<br> is unsaturated. If the oil or fat is "
"saturated, <br>the violet colour of iodine does not fade away. <br>Here "
"linseed oil is more unsaturated than cotton seed oil."

